Subject: Optimization broken in 2.0; "moving" to "experimental"
Message-ID: <5JgXBJHx6wM.axLrZ6Nnt_wJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <5JgXBJHx6wM.9TlB7KDB65EJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <5JgXBJHx6wM._OR9nkUYqBYJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <5JgXBJHx6wM.9TlB7KDB65EJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
