Is there a reason to have this function signature:

   real trace_quad_form(matrix m, vector v)

     =def=  trace(v' * m * v)

This looks like it'll define the same function as

   real quad_form(matrix m, vector v)

     =def= v' * m * v

So we're just going to scratch the signature for trace_quad_form.

(We're leaving trace_quad_form(matrix,matrix):real, of course.)

- Bob

