- removing unused function signatures
  https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/pull/274
- fixing optimization
  https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/pull/261

Both are queued on Jenkins and will hopefully pass.

We will merge these branches without the full test suite since they don't touch code:
- manual fixes
  feature/issue-211-stan2-manual
- adding citations to the website
  feature/issue-187-citations
- updating website version
  feature/issue-246-website

After all of that gets in, I will tag the repository with v2.0.0-RC1. I expect this will happen Sunday.

Jiqiang, are you ok with releasing this weekend?

Daniel

