i686-apple-darwin11-llvm-g++-4.2: src/stan/model/model_header.hpp: linker input file unused because linking not done
g++ -I src -isystem lib/eigen_3.2.0 -isystem lib/boost_1.54.0 -Wall -DBOOST_RESULT_OF_USE_TR1 -DBOOST_NO_DECLTYPE -DBOOST_DISABLE_ASSERTS -Wno-unused-function -ftemplate-depth=256   -c -O3 -o bin/stan/command/stanc.o src/stan/command/stanc.cpp
