On Sat, Oct 12, 2013 at 2:29 PM, Daniel Lee <bea...@alum.mit.edu> wrote:

> Bob and/or Jiqiang,
>
> Can you try out this branch and see if it works for XCode 5?
> feature/issue-278-Xcode5
>
> The pull request is here:
> https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/pull/279
