[moving to stan-dev]

Two issues:

The log probability doesn't agree with what we had in 1.3.

Also, the derivatives don't match the finite differences calc.
They're off by a convenient factor of 2.

I didn't debug the 2.0 version, just swapped back in the
1.3 version.

I'd rather not refactor again until we have much better
tests in place.  For this and our other multivariate
distributions.

- Bob

