For covariance matrices, init = 0 will conveniently
initialize to the identity matrix, because in the
underlying Cholesky factor, below-diag entries
are 0 and diag entries are exp(0) = 1.

I have no idea what init=0 does for correlation
matrices, though, which is a different topic not
related to inv_wishart behavior.

- Bob

